{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2021-09-16 09:00:00', 'title': 'BOOK TODAY: SOUTHWEST AIRLINES EXTENDS FLIGHT SCHEDULE THROUGH APRIL 24, 2022', 'text': 'DALLAS, SEPT. 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. \xa0(NYSE: LUV) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT EXTENDED ITS BOOKABLE FLIGHT SCHEDULE THROUGH APRIL 24, 2022, GIVING CUSTOMERS THE ABILITY TO PLAN AND BOOK THEIR EARLY 2022 TRAVEL AT SOUTHWEST.COM.'}